                "text": "Each year, we acknowledge #WorldAIDSDay to remember the lives lost and renew our vow to fight this disease. We have the tools to prevent AIDS-related deaths.\u00a0We must encourage testing, promote education, and end stigmas that prevent people from receiving life-saving treatment. https://t.co/1hAznYP4Cc",
