                "text": "Moms often face bias, career interruptions, & lower pay after having a child \u2013 leading to moms making 62 cents for every dollar dads make.\u00a0\n\nOn #MomsEqualPayDay, we must acknowledge the unequal treatment of moms vs. dads and fight to give every parent the same opportunities.",
